@RoundId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Round with its phase and season, and the previous and next round of the season (take the id from GET /seasons/{id})
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/rounds/{{RoundId}}
Accept: application/json

### Error: the round does not exist (404)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/rounds/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Accept: application/json

### Error: the id is not a GUID (404, the route does not match)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/rounds/not-a-guid
Accept: application/json
